-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Nature of this project
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package is primarily an INTEGRATION and ADAPTATION layer: it wires the
MIT-licensed dsh-redteam-model and dsh-redteam-mode projects into DeepSeek
Harness agent presets under a common tool prefix, and adds its own tooling
(staged engagement ledger, stage gates, an experience store), skills and docs.

A large part of the text, skill and preset content was produced with AI
assistants and then reviewed, arranged and edited by the project's maintainer.
Copyright in purely machine-generated portions may be uncertain; everything
redistributed from the upstream projects listed below is MIT-licensed and its
notices are retained. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for the per-part provenance
and the byte-level comparisons behind it.

